        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "UAE National Day marketing is one of the best chances of the year to connect with customers, because the whole country is in a celebration mood. Shoppers are off work, families are out, and everyone is looking at their phones. But a flag in your logo is not a strategy, and businesses that post a generic greeting on the day usually get a few likes and no sales."
